about=\\\"#mwt81\\\">.mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}</style>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>I’m reading <b>the</b> book Mary reviewed.</i> (Compare <i>I’m reading <b>a</b> book Mary reviewed.</i>)\"},{\"example\":\"<i>You live on Main Street, don't you? You know, you should tell the mayor <b>the</b> street needs cleaning.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i><b>The</b> men and women watched <b>the</b> man give <b>the</b> birdseed to <b>the</b> bird.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i><b>the</b> street that runs all the way through my hometown</i>\"},{\"translation\":\"<i><b>the</b> cow jumped over the moon (1760 (date first published), Mother Goose's Melody (the book title), \\\"Hey Diddle Diddle\\\" (the rhyme title))</i>\",\"example\":\"<i>A car is parked right outside my house. Since it's difficult to find a parking space, I hope </i>the<i> car won't be there later.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>No one knows how many galaxies there are in <b>the</b> universe.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>God save <b>the</b> Queen!</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>Lets go to <b>the</b> park </i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>No one in <b>the</b> whole country had seen it before.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>I don't think I'll get to it until <b>the</b> morning.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>Take me to <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/airport\\\" title=\\\"airport\\\">airport</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/station\\\" title=\\\"station\\\">station</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/hospital\\\" title=\\\"hospital\\\">hospital</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/office\\\" title=\\\"office\\\">office</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/park\\\" title=\\\"park\\\">park</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/match\\\" title=\\\"match\\\">match</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/meeting\\\" title=\\\"meeting\\\">meeting</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/et_cetera\\\" title=\\\"et cetera\\\">et cetera</a>.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>A stone hit him on <b>the</b> head.</i> (= “A stone hit him on his head.”)\"},{\"example\":\"<i>How's <b>the</b> wife?</i> (= \\\"How is your wife?\\\")\"},{\"example\":\"How's <b>the</b> Sal today<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">?</span>\",\"footer\":\"\\\"How are you, Sal?\\\"\"},{\"example\":\"<i><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/square_the_circle\\\" title=\\\"square the circle\\\">square <b>the</b> circle</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/feel_the_pinch\\\" title=\\\"feel the pinch\\\">feel <b>the</b> pinch</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/beat_around_the_bush\\\" title=\\\"beat around the bush\\\">beat around <b>the</b> bush</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/throw_the_baby_out_with_the_bathwater\\\" title=\\\"throw the baby out with the bathwater\\\">throw <b>the</b> baby out with <b>the</b> bathwater</a></i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>That is</i> <u><b>the</b></u> <i>hospital to go to for heart surgery.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"That was <b>the</b> juiciest apple pie ever.\"},{\"example\":\"May <b>the</b> better man win.\"},{\"example\":\"<i><b>The</b> downy woodpecker can be found in the same environments as <b>the</b> hairy woodpecker.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i><b>The</b> Bushes have held political office for several decades and <b>the</b> Kennedys longer.</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>I’m reading <b>the</b> book Mary reviewed.</i> (Compare <i>I’m reading <b>a</b> book Mary reviewed.</i>)\",\"<i>You live on Main Street, don't you? You know, you should tell the mayor <b>the</b> street needs cleaning.</i>\",\"<i><b>The</b> men and women watched <b>the</b> man give <b>the</b> birdseed to <b>the</b> bird.</i>\",\"<i><b>the</b> street that runs all the way through my hometown</i>\",\"<i>A car is parked right outside my house. Since it's difficult to find a parking space, I hope </i>the<i> car won't be there later.</i>\",\"<i>No one knows how many galaxies there are in <b>the</b> universe.</i>\",\"<i>God save <b>the</b> Queen!</i>\",\"<i>Lets go to <b>the</b> park </i>\",\"<i>No one in <b>the</b> whole country had seen it before.</i>\",\"<i>I don't think I'll get to it until <b>the</b> morning.</i>\",\"<i>Take me to <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/airport\\\" title=\\\"airport\\\">airport</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/station\\\" title=\\\"station\\\">station</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/hospital\\\" title=\\\"hospital\\\">hospital</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/office\\\" title=\\\"office\\\">office</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/park\\\" title=\\\"park\\\">park</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/match\\\" title=\\\"match\\\">match</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/meeting\\\" title=\\\"meeting\\\">meeting</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/et_cetera\\\" title=\\\"et cetera\\\">et cetera</a>.</i>\",\"<i>A stone hit him on <b>the</b> head.</i> (= “A stone hit him on his head.”)\",\"<i>How's <b>the</b> wife?</i> (= \\\"How is your wife?\\\")\",\"How's <b>the</b> Sal today<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">?</span>\",\"<i><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/square_the_circle\\\" title=\\\"square the circle\\\">square <b>the</b> circle</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/feel_the_pinch\\\" title=\\\"feel the pinch\\\">feel <b>the</b> pinch</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/beat_around_the_bush\\\" title=\\\"beat around the bush\\\">beat around <b>the</b> bush</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/throw_the_baby_out_with_the_bathwater\\\" title=\\\"throw the baby out with the bathwater\\\">throw <b>the</b> baby out with <b>the</b> bathwater</a></i>\",\"<i>That is</i> <u><b>the</b></u> <i>hospital to go to for heart surgery.</i>\",\"That was <b>the</b> juiciest apple pie ever.\",\"May <b>the</b> better man win.\",\"<i><b>The</b> downy woodpecker can be found in the same environments as <b>the</b> hairy woodpecker.</i>\",\"<i><b>The</b> Bushes have held political office for several decades and <b>the</b> Kennedys longer.</i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt79\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">The <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/definite#English\\\" title=\\\"definite\\\">definite</a> grammatical <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/article#English\\\" title=\\\"article\\\">article</a> that shows that the noun phrase that immediately follows it is definitely identifiable...</span>\\n<ol><li><span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt80\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">...because it has already been <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/mention#English\\\" title=\\\"mention\\\">mentioned</a>, is to be completely <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/specify#English\\\" title=\\\"specify\\\">specified</a> in the same sentence, or very shortly thereafter.</span> <style data-mw-deduplicate=\\\"TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\" about=\\\"#mwt81\\\">.mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}</style>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>I’m reading <b>the</b> book Mary reviewed.</i> (Compare <i>I’m reading <b>a</b> book Mary reviewed.</i>)\"},{\"example\":\"<i>You live on Main Street, don't you? You know, you should tell the mayor <b>the</b> street needs cleaning.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i><b>The</b> men and women watched <b>the</b> man give <b>the</b> birdseed to <b>the</b> bird.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i><b>the</b> street that runs all the way through my hometown</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>A car is parked right outside my house. Since it's difficult to find a parking space, I hope </i>the<i> car won't be there later.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>No one knows how many galaxies there are in <b>the</b> universe.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>God save <b>the</b> Queen!</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>Lets go to <b>the</b> park </i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>No one in <b>the</b> whole country had seen it before.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>I don't think I'll get to it until <b>the</b> morning.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>Take me to <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/airport\\\" title=\\\"airport\\\">airport</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/station\\\" title=\\\"station\\\">station</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/hospital\\\" title=\\\"hospital\\\">hospital</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/office\\\" title=\\\"office\\\">office</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/park\\\" title=\\\"park\\\">park</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/match\\\" title=\\\"match\\\">match</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/meeting\\\" title=\\\"meeting\\\">meeting</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/et_cetera\\\" title=\\\"et cetera\\\">et cetera</a>.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>A stone hit him on <b>the</b> head.</i> (= “A stone hit him on his head.”)\"},{\"example\":\"<i>How's <b>the</b> wife?</i> (= \\\"How is your wife?\\\")\"},{\"example\":\"How's <b>the</b> Sal today<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">?</span>\",\"footer\":\"\\\"How are you, Sal?\\\"\"},{\"example\":\"<i><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/square_the_circle\\\" title=\\\"square the circle\\\">square <b>the</b> circle</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/feel_the_pinch\\\" title=\\\"feel the pinch\\\">feel <b>the</b> pinch</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/beat_around_the_bush\\\" title=\\\"beat around the bush\\\">beat around <b>the</b> bush</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/throw_the_baby_out_with_the_bathwater\\\" title=\\\"throw the baby out with the bathwater\\\">throw <b>the</b> baby out with <b>the</b> bathwater</a></i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>I’m reading <b>the</b> book Mary reviewed.</i> (Compare <i>I’m reading <b>a</b> book Mary reviewed.</i>)\",\"<i>You live on Main Street, don't you? You know, you should tell the mayor <b>the</b> street needs cleaning.</i>\",\"<i><b>The</b> men and women watched <b>the</b> man give <b>the</b> birdseed to <b>the</b> bird.</i>\",\"<i><b>the</b> street that runs all the way through my hometown</i>\",\"<i>A car is parked right outside my house. Since it's difficult to find a parking space, I hope </i>the<i> car won't be there later.</i>\",\"<i>No one knows how many galaxies there are in <b>the</b> universe.</i>\",\"<i>God save <b>the</b> Queen!</i>\",\"<i>Lets go to <b>the</b> park </i>\",\"<i>No one in <b>the</b> whole country had seen it before.</i>\",\"<i>I don't think I'll get to it until <b>the</b> morning.</i>\",\"<i>Take me to <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/airport\\\" title=\\\"airport\\\">airport</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/station\\\" title=\\\"station\\\">station</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/hospital\\\" title=\\\"hospital\\\">hospital</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/office\\\" title=\\\"office\\\">office</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/park\\\" title=\\\"park\\\">park</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/match\\\" title=\\\"match\\\">match</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/meeting\\\" title=\\\"meeting\\\">meeting</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/et_cetera\\\" title=\\\"et cetera\\\">et cetera</a>.</i>\",\"<i>A stone hit him on <b>the</b> head.</i> (= “A stone hit him on his head.”)\",\"<i>How's <b>the</b> wife?</i> (= \\\"How is your wife?\\\")\",\"How's <b>the</b> Sal today<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">?</span>\",\"<i><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/square_the_circle\\\" title=\\\"square the circle\\\">square <b>the</b> circle</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/feel_the_pinch\\\" title=\\\"feel the pinch\\\">feel <b>the</b> pinch</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/beat_around_the_bush\\\" title=\\\"beat around the bush\\\">beat around <b>the</b> bush</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/throw_the_baby_out_with_the_bathwater\\\" title=\\\"throw the baby out with the bathwater\\\">throw <b>the</b> baby out with <b>the</b> bathwater</a></i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt80\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">...because it has already been <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/mention#English\\\" title=\\\"mention\\\">mentioned</a>, is to be completely <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/specify#English\\\" title=\\\"specify\\\">specified</a> in the same sentence, or very shortly thereafter.</span> <style data-mw-deduplicate=\\\"TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\" about=\\\"#mwt81\\\">.mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}</style>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>I’m reading <b>the</b> book Mary reviewed.</i> (Compare <i>I’m reading <b>a</b> book Mary reviewed.</i>)\"},{\"example\":\"<i>You live on Main Street, don't you? You know, you should tell the mayor <b>the</b> street needs cleaning.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i><b>The</b> men and women watched <b>the</b> man give <b>the</b> birdseed to <b>the</b> bird.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i><b>the</b> street that runs all the way through my hometown</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>A car is parked right outside my house. Since it's difficult to find a parking space, I hope </i>the<i> car won't be there later.</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>I’m reading <b>the</b> book Mary reviewed.</i> (Compare <i>I’m reading <b>a</b> book Mary reviewed.</i>)\",\"<i>You live on Main Street, don't you? You know, you should tell the mayor <b>the</b> street needs cleaning.</i>\",\"<i><b>The</b> men and women watched <b>the</b> man give <b>the</b> birdseed to <b>the</b> bird.</i>\",\"<i><b>the</b> street that runs all the way through my hometown</i>\",\"<i>A car is parked right outside my house. Since it's difficult to find a parking space, I hope </i>the<i> car won't be there later.</i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt84\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">...because it is presumed to be definitely known in context or from shared knowledge.</span>\\n<ol><li><span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt85\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Used before a noun designating something considered to be <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/unique#English\\\" title=\\\"unique\\\">unique</a>, or of which there is only one at a time.</span> <link rel=\\\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\\\" href=\\\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" about=\\\"#mwt86\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\">\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>No one knows how many galaxies there are in <b>the</b> universe.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>God save <b>the</b> Queen!</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>Lets go to <b>the</b> park </i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>No one in <b>the</b> whole country had seen it before.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>I don't think I'll get to it until <b>the</b> morning.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>Take me to <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/airport\\\" title=\\\"airport\\\">airport</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/station\\\" title=\\\"station\\\">station</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/hospital\\\" title=\\\"hospital\\\">hospital</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/office\\\" title=\\\"office\\\">office</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/park\\\" title=\\\"park\\\">park</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/match\\\" title=\\\"match\\\">match</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/meeting\\\" title=\\\"meeting\\\">meeting</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/et_cetera\\\" title=\\\"et cetera\\\">et cetera</a>.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>A stone hit him on <b>the</b> head.</i> (= “A stone hit him on his head.”)\"},{\"example\":\"<i>How's <b>the</b> wife?</i> (= \\\"How is your wife?\\\")\"},{\"example\":\"How's <b>the</b> Sal today<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">?</span>\",\"footer\":\"\\\"How are you, Sal?\\\"\"},{\"example\":\"<i><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/square_the_circle\\\" title=\\\"square the circle\\\">square <b>the</b> circle</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/feel_the_pinch\\\" title=\\\"feel the pinch\\\">feel <b>the</b> pinch</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/beat_around_the_bush\\\" title=\\\"beat around the bush\\\">beat around <b>the</b> bush</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/throw_the_baby_out_with_the_bathwater\\\" title=\\\"throw the baby out with the bathwater\\\">throw <b>the</b> baby out with <b>the</b> bathwater</a></i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>No one knows how many galaxies there are in <b>the</b> universe.</i>\",\"<i>God save <b>the</b> Queen!</i>\",\"<i>Lets go to <b>the</b> park </i>\",\"<i>No one in <b>the</b> whole country had seen it before.</i>\",\"<i>I don't think I'll get to it until <b>the</b> morning.</i>\",\"<i>Take me to <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/airport\\\" title=\\\"airport\\\">airport</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/station\\\" title=\\\"station\\\">station</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/hospital\\\" title=\\\"hospital\\\">hospital</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/office\\\" title=\\\"office\\\">office</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/park\\\" title=\\\"park\\\">park</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/match\\\" title=\\\"match\\\">match</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/meeting\\\" title=\\\"meeting\\\">meeting</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/et_cetera\\\" title=\\\"et cetera\\\">et cetera</a>.</i>\",\"<i>A stone hit him on <b>the</b> head.</i> (= “A stone hit him on his head.”)\",\"<i>How's <b>the</b> wife?</i> (= \\\"How is your wife?\\\")\",\"How's <b>the</b> Sal today<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">?</span>\",\"<i><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/square_the_circle\\\" title=\\\"square the circle\\\">square <b>the</b> circle</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/feel_the_pinch\\\" title=\\\"feel the pinch\\\">feel <b>the</b> pinch</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/beat_around_the_bush\\\" title=\\\"beat around the bush\\\">beat around <b>the</b> bush</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/throw_the_baby_out_with_the_bathwater\\\" title=\\\"throw the baby out with the bathwater\\\">throw <b>the</b> baby out with <b>the</b> bathwater</a></i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt85\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Used before a noun designating something considered to be <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/unique#English\\\" title=\\\"unique\\\">unique</a>, or of which there is only one at a time.</span> <link rel=\\\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\\\" href=\\\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" about=\\\"#mwt86\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\">\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>No one knows how many galaxies there are in <b>the</b> universe.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>God save <b>the</b> Queen!</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>Lets go to <b>the</b> park </i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>No one knows how many galaxies there are in <b>the</b> universe.</i>\",\"<i>God save <b>the</b> Queen!</i>\",\"<i>Lets go to <b>the</b> park </i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt89\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Used to indicate a certain example of (a noun) which is usually of most concern or most common or familiar.</span> <link rel=\\\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\\\" href=\\\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" about=\\\"#mwt90\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\">\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>No one in <b>the</b> whole country had seen it before.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>I don't think I'll get to it until <b>the</b> morning.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>Take me to <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/airport\\\" title=\\\"airport\\\">airport</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/station\\\" title=\\\"station\\\">station</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/hospital\\\" title=\\\"hospital\\\">hospital</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/office\\\" title=\\\"office\\\">office</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/park\\\" title=\\\"park\\\">park</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/match\\\" title=\\\"match\\\">match</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/meeting\\\" title=\\\"meeting\\\">meeting</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/et_cetera\\\" title=\\\"et cetera\\\">et cetera</a>.</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>No one in <b>the</b> whole country had seen it before.</i>\",\"<i>I don't think I'll get to it until <b>the</b> morning.</i>\",\"<i>Take me to <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/airport\\\" title=\\\"airport\\\">airport</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/station\\\" title=\\\"station\\\">station</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/hospital\\\" title=\\\"hospital\\\">hospital</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/office\\\" title=\\\"office\\\">office</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/park\\\" title=\\\"park\\\">park</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/match\\\" title=\\\"match\\\">match</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/meeting\\\" title=\\\"meeting\\\">meeting</a>/<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/et_cetera\\\" title=\\\"et cetera\\\">et cetera</a>.</i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt92\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Used before a body part, a family member, a pet (especially of someone previously mentioned), as an alternative to a <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/possessive_pronoun#English\\\" title=\\\"possessive pronoun\\\">possessive pronoun</a>.</span> <link rel=\\\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\\\" href=\\\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" about=\\\"#mwt93\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\">\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>A stone hit him on <b>the</b> head.</i> (= “A stone hit him on his head.”)\"},{\"example\":\"<i>How's <b>the</b> wife?</i> (= \\\"How is your wife?\\\")\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>A stone hit him on <b>the</b> head.</i> (= “A stone hit him on his head.”)\",\"<i>How's <b>the</b> wife?</i> (= \\\"How is your wife?\\\")\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"usage-label-sense\\\" about=\\\"#mwt96\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\"></span> <span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt97\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Precedes a familiar nickname or other term of address.</span>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"How's <b>the</b> Sal today<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">?</span>\",\"footer\":\"\\\"How are you, Sal?\\\"\"}],\"examples\":[\"How's <b>the</b> Sal today<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">?</span>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt99\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Used in many idiomatic expressions and proverbs to refer to common objects, roles, or situations connected with something definite, in the manner of an analogy</span>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/square_the_circle\\\" title=\\\"square the circle\\\">square <b>the</b> circle</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/feel_the_pinch\\\" title=\\\"feel the pinch\\\">feel <b>the</b> pinch</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/beat_around_the_bush\\\" title=\\\"beat around the bush\\\">beat around <b>the</b> bush</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/throw_the_baby_out_with_the_bathwater\\\" title=\\\"throw the baby out with the bathwater\\\">throw <b>the</b> baby out with <b>the</b> bathwater</a></i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/square_the_circle\\\" title=\\\"square the circle\\\">square <b>the</b> circle</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/feel_the_pinch\\\" title=\\\"feel the pinch\\\">feel <b>the</b> pinch</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/beat_around_the_bush\\\" title=\\\"beat around the bush\\\">beat around <b>the</b> bush</a>; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/throw_the_baby_out_with_the_bathwater\\\" title=\\\"throw the baby out with the bathwater\\\">throw <b>the</b> baby out with <b>the</b> bathwater</a></i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt100\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">When stressed, indicates that it describes something which is considered to be best or exclusively worthy of attention.</span> <link rel=\\\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\\\" href=\\\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" about=\\\"#mwt101\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\">\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>That is</i> <u><b>the</b></u> <i>hospital to go to for heart surgery.</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>That is</i> <u><b>the</b></u> <i>hospital to go to for heart surgery.</i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt105\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">When stressed, used before the name of a famous person, to distinguish said person from a hypothetical lesser-known person with the same name.</span>\"},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt108\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Used before a noun phrase beginning with <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/superlative#English\\\" title=\\\"superlative\\\">superlative</a> or comparative adjective or an <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/ordinal_number#English\\\" title=\\\"ordinal number\\\">ordinal number</a>,  indicating that the noun refers to a single item.</span>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"That was <b>the</b> juiciest apple pie ever.\"},{\"example\":\"May <b>the</b> better man win.\"}],\"examples\":[\"That was <b>the</b> juiciest apple pie ever.\",\"May <b>the</b> better man win.\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt112\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Introducing a singular term to be taken <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/generically#English\\\" title=\\\"generically\\\">generically</a><span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">:</span> preceding a name of something standing for a whole class.</span> <link rel=\\\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\\\" href=\\\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" about=\\\"#mwt113\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\">\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i><b>The</b> downy woodpecker can be found in the same environments as <b>the</b> hairy woodpecker.</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i><b>The</b> downy woodpecker can be found in the same environments as <b>the</b> hairy woodpecker.</i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt116\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Used with the plural of a surname to indicate the entire family.</span>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i><b>The</b> Bushes have held political office for several decades and <b>the</b> Kennedys longer.</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i><b>The</b> Bushes have held political office for several decades and <b>the</b> Kennedys longer.</i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt117\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Used with an adjective</span>\\n<ol><li><span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt118\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Added to a superlative or an ordinal number to make it into a <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#substantive\\\" title=\\\"Appendix:Glossary\\\">substantive</a>.</span> <link rel=\\\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\\\" href=\\\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" about=\\\"#mwt119\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\">\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>That apple pie was <b>the</b> best.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>Feed <b>the</b> hungry, clothe <b>the</b> naked, comfort <b>the</b> afflicted, and afflict <b>the</b> comfortable.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>One doesn't choose the color of one's chess pieces; <b>the</b> white are assigned to the player who moves first.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i><b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Irish\\\" title=\\\"Irish\\\">Irish</a> are...; <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Chinese\\\" title=\\\"Chinese\\\">Chinese</a> are...; <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/French\\\" title=\\\"French\\\">French</a> are...</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>That apple pie was <b>the</b> best.</i>\",\"<i>Feed <b>the</b> hungry, clothe <b>the</b> naked, comfort <b>the</b> afflicted, and afflict <b>the</b> comfortable.</i>\",\"<i>One doesn't choose the color of one's chess pieces; <b>the</b> white are assigned to the player who moves first.</i>\",\"<i><b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Irish\\\" title=\\\"Irish\\\">Irish</a> are...; <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Chinese\\\" title=\\\"Chinese\\\">Chinese</a> are...; <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/French\\\" title=\\\"French\\\">French</a> are...</i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt118\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Added to a superlative or an ordinal number to make it into a <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#substantive\\\" title=\\\"Appendix:Glossary\\\">substantive</a>.</span> <link rel=\\\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\\\" href=\\\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" about=\\\"#mwt119\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\">\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>That apple pie was <b>the</b> best.</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>That apple pie was <b>the</b> best.</i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt121\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Used before an adjective, indicating all things (especially persons) described by that adjective.</span> <link rel=\\\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\\\" href=\\\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\\\" about=\\\"#mwt122\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\\\">\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i>Feed <b>the</b> hungry, clothe <b>the</b> naked, comfort <b>the</b> afflicted, and afflict <b>the</b> comfortable.</i>\"},{\"example\":\"<i>One doesn't choose the color of one's chess pieces; <b>the</b> white are assigned to the player who moves first.</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>Feed <b>the</b> hungry, clothe <b>the</b> naked, comfort <b>the</b> afflicted, and afflict <b>the</b> comfortable.</i>\",\"<i>One doesn't choose the color of one's chess pieces; <b>the</b> white are assigned to the player who moves first.</i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt124\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">Used before a <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/demonym#English\\\" title=\\\"demonym\\\">demonym</a> ending in <i class=\\\"Latn mention nowrap\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/-ish#English:_nationality\\\" title=\\\"-ish\\\">-ish</a></i> or <i class=\\\"Latn mention nowrap\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/-ese#English\\\" title=\\\"-ese\\\">-ese</a></i> to refer to people of a given <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/country#English\\\" title=\\\"country\\\">country</a> collectively.</span>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i><b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Irish\\\" title=\\\"Irish\\\">Irish</a> are...; <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Chinese\\\" title=\\\"Chinese\\\">Chinese</a> are...; <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/French\\\" title=\\\"French\\\">French</a> are...</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i><b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Irish\\\" title=\\\"Irish\\\">Irish</a> are...; <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Chinese\\\" title=\\\"Chinese\\\">Chinese</a> are...; <b>the</b> <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/French\\\" title=\\\"French\\\">French</a> are...</i>\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"mw-cite-backlink\\\"><a href=\\\"/wiki/the#cite_ref-1\\\" rel=\\\"mw:referencedBy\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-linkback-text\\\">↑</span></a></span> <span id=\\\"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1\\\" class=\\\"mw-reference-text reference-text\\\"><span class=\\\"citation-whole\\\" about=\\\"#mwt74\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\"><span class=\\\"cited-source\\\">Dunkel, George E. (<span class=\\\"None\\\" lang=\\\"und\\\">2014</span>), <cite><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\\\" href=\\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lexikon%20der%20indogermanischen%20Partikeln%20und%20Pronominalstämme\\\" title=\\\"w:Lexikon der indogermanischen Partikeln und Pronominalstämme\\\" class=\\\"extiw\\\">Lexikon der indogermanischen Partikeln und Pronominalstämme</a></cite> <span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">[</span><cite><span class=\\\"e-translation\\\">Lexicon of Indo-European Particles and Pronominal Stems</span></cite><span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">]</span><span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">‎</span> (in German), volume 2: Lexikon, Heidelberg<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">:</span> Universitätsverlag Winter, <small><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/9783825359263\\\" title=\\\"Special:BookSources/9783825359263\\\">→ISBN</a></small>, pages <span class=\\\"None\\\" lang=\\\"und\\\">732-733</span></span></span></span>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Adverb\",\"language\":\"English\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt671\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">With a <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/comparative#English\\\" title=\\\"comparative\\\">comparative</a> or with <i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/more#English\\\" title=\\\"more\\\">more</a></i> and a verb phrase, establishes a correlation with one or more other such comparatives.</span>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i><b>The</b> hotter(,) <b>the</b> better.</i> <span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren\\\" about=\\\"#mwt672\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss\\\" about=\\\"#mwt672\\\">comma usually omitted in such very short expressions</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren\\\" about=\\\"#mwt672\\\">)</span>\"},{\"example\":\"<b>The</b> more I think about it, <b>the</b> weaker it looks.\"},{\"example\":\"<b>The</b> more money donated, <b>the</b> more books purchased, and <b>the</b> more happy children.\"},{\"example\":\"It looks weaker and weaker, <b>the</b> more I think about it.\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i><b>The</b> hotter(,) <b>the</b> better.</i> <span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren\\\" about=\\\"#mwt672\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss\\\" about=\\\"#mwt672\\\">comma usually omitted in such very short expressions</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren\\\" about=\\\"#mwt672\\\">)</span>\",\"<b>The</b> more I think about it, <b>the</b> weaker it looks.\",\"<b>The</b> more money donated, <b>the</b> more books purchased, and <b>the</b> more happy children.\",\"It looks weaker and weaker, <b>the</b> more I think about it.\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt676\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">With a <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/comparative#English\\\" title=\\\"comparative\\\">comparative</a>, and often with <i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/for_it#English\\\" title=\\\"for it\\\">for it</a></i>, indicates a result more like said comparative. This can be negated with <i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/none#English\\\" title=\\\"none\\\">none</a></i>.</span>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"It was a difficult time, but I’m <b>the</b> wiser for it.\"},{\"example\":\"It was a difficult time, and I’m <span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">{</span>none - not any<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">}</span> <b>the</b> wiser for it.\"},{\"example\":\"I'm much <b>the</b> wiser for having had a difficult time like that.\"}],\"examples\":[\"It was a difficult time, but I’m <b>the</b> wiser for it.\",\"It was a difficult time, and I’m <span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">{</span>none - not any<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">}</span> <b>the</b> wiser for it.\",\"I'm much <b>the</b> wiser for having had a difficult time like that.\"]},{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"usage-label-sense\\\" about=\\\"#mwt680\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\"></span> Beyond all others.\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"We went <b>the</b> furthest under her leadership.\"},{\"example\":\"They trusted him <b>the</b> most.\"}],\"examples\":[\"We went <b>the</b> furthest under her leadership.\",\"They trusted him <b>the</b> most.\"]}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Preposition\",\"language\":\"English\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"For each; <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/per\\\" title=\\\"per\\\">per</a>.\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"valued at half a pound <b>the</b> bushel<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">;</span> paying seven dollars <b>the</b> year interest\"}],\"examples\":[\"valued at half a pound <b>the</b> bushel<span typeof=\\\"mw:Entity\\\">;</span> paying seven dollars <b>the</b> year interest\"]}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Pronoun\",\"language\":\"English\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt755\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#obsolete\\\" title=\\\"Appendix:Glossary\\\">Obsolete</a> form of <span class=\\\"form-of-definition-link\\\"><i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/thee#English\\\" title=\\\"thee\\\">thee</a></i></span></span><link rel=\\\"mw:PageProp/Category\\\" href=\\\"./Category:English_obsolete_forms#THE\\\" about=\\\"#mwt755\\\">.\"}]}],\"other\":[{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Article\",\"language\":\"Crimean Gothic\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/the#English\\\" class=\\\"mw-selflink-fragment\\\">the</a>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Pronoun\",\"language\":\"Eastern Arrernte\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/I\\\" title=\\\"I\\\">I</a> <span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren\\\" about=\\\"#mwt780\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss\\\" about=\\\"#mwt780\\\">first person singular pronoun</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren\\\" about=\\\"#mwt780\\\">)</span>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Pronoun\",\"language\":\"Hadza\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"you (thou)\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Article\",\"language\":\"Middle English\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt793\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">alternative form of <span class=\\\"form-of-definition-link\\\"><i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"enm\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/þe#Middle_English:_the\\\" title=\\\"þe\\\">þe</a></i> <span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-double-quote\\\">“</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss\\\">the</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-double-quote\\\">”</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\\\">)</span></span></span>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Pronoun\",\"language\":\"Middle English\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt798\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">alternative form of <span class=\\\"form-of-definition-link\\\"><i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"enm\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/þe#Middle_English:_thee\\\" title=\\\"þe\\\">þe</a></i> <span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-double-quote\\\">“</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss\\\">thee</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-double-quote\\\">”</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\\\">)</span></span></span>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Pronoun\",\"language\":\"Middle English\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt800\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">alternative form of <span class=\\\"form-of-definition-link\\\"><i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"enm\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/þei#Middle_English\\\" title=\\\"þei\\\">þei</a></i> <span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-double-quote\\\">“</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss\\\">they</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-double-quote\\\">”</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\\\">)</span></span></span>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Verb\",\"language\":\"Middle English\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt802\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">alternative form of <span class=\\\"form-of-definition-link\\\"><i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"enm\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/theen#Middle_English\\\" title=\\\"theen\\\">theen</a></i></span></span>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Noun\",\"language\":\"Murrinh-Patha\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/ear\\\" title=\\\"ear\\\">ear</a>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Particle\",\"language\":\"Old High German\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/that\\\" title=\\\"that\\\">that</a>, <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/who\\\" title=\\\"who\\\">who</a>, <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/which\\\" title=\\\"which\\\">which</a>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Determiner\",\"language\":\"Old Saxon\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/that\\\" title=\\\"that\\\">that</a>, <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/that_one\\\" title=\\\"that one\\\">that one</a>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"example\":\"<i><b>them</b> uuīha uuīsa lēstean</i>: To obey <b>that</b> holy wise.\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i><b>them</b> uuīha uuīsa lēstean</i>: To obey <b>that</b> holy wise.\"]}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Particle\",\"language\":\"Old Saxon\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/that\\\" title=\\\"that\\\">that</a>, <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/who\\\" title=\\\"who\\\">who</a>, <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/which\\\" title=\\\"which\\\">which</a>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Noun\",\"language\":\"South Slavey\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/belt\\\" title=\\\"belt\\\">belt</a>\"}]},{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Article\",\"language\":\"Yola\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt878\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">alternative form of <span class=\\\"form-of-definition-link\\\"><i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"yol\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/a/languages_M_to_Z#Yola\\\" title=\\\"a/languages M to Z\\\">a</a></i> <span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-double-quote\\\">“</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss\\\">the</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-double-quote\\\">”</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\\\">)</span></span></span>\"}]}],\"da\":[{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Noun\",\"language\":\"Danish\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt774\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">alternative spelling of <span class=\\\"form-of-definition-link\\\"><i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"da\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/te#Danish\\\" title=\\\"te\\\">