\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\" about=\\\"#mwt844\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/the#English\\\" class=\\\"mw-selflink-fragment\\\">the</a></span> <span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren\\\" about=\\\"#mwt845\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">(</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss\\\" about=\\\"#mwt845\\\">definite article</span><span class=\\\"mention-gloss-paren\\\" about=\\\"#mwt845\\\">)</span>\"}]}],\"sh\":[{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Conjunction\",\"language\":\"Serbo-Croatian\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"usage-label-sense\\\" about=\\\"#mwt850\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\"></span> <span class=\\\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt851\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\">alternative spelling of <span class=\\\"form-of-definition-link\\\"><i class=\\\"Latn mention\\\" lang=\\\"sh\\\"><a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/da#Serbo-Croatian\\\" title=\\\"da\\\">da</a></i></span></span>\",\"parsedExamples\":[{\"translation\":\"some jerk to fuck with them emotionally\",\"example\":\"<i>neki kreten <b>the</b> ih <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/drkati\\\" title=\\\"drkati\\\">drka</a> emotivno</i>\"},{\"translation\":\"if I posted this on my FB wall, I surely wouldn't survive the women rights fighters\",\"example\":\"<i><b>the</b> ovo okačim na <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/fb\\\" title=\\\"fb\\\">fb</a> wall, garant ne bih opstala od borKINJa za ženska prava</i>\"}],\"examples\":[\"<i>neki kreten <b>the</b> ih <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/drkati\\\" title=\\\"drkati\\\">drka</a> emotivno</i>\",\"<i><b>the</b> ovo okačim na <a rel=\\\"mw:WikiLink\\\" href=\\\"/wiki/fb\\\" title=\\\"fb\\\">fb</a> wall, garant ne bih opstala od borKINJa za ženska prava</i>\"]}]}],\"sv\":[{\"partOfSpeech\":\"Noun\",\"language\":\"Swedish\",\"definitions\":[{\"definition\":\"<span class=\\\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\\\" about=\\\"#mwt860\\\" typeof=\\\"mw:Transclusion\\\